   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for the improvement of the capacity of the civil society      organizations to promote gender equality, the enjoiment of all rights of women and struggle to end gender based and violence. The prinipal  characteristic is the creation of networks and alliances of           organizations to work on: politcal participation, SRHR, prevention    and elimination of gender based on violence and empower of adolescent</narrative>
